#### Register a new user
POST {{url}}/api/accounts/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "shee",
    "email": "sheilla@example.com",
    "password": "sheilla123",
    "password2": "sheilla123",
    "first_name": "Sheilla",
    "last_name": "Mungai"
}

### Login
POST {{url}}/api/accounts/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "shee",
    "password": "sheilla123"
}

### Get user profile (requires token)
GET {{url}}/api/profiles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### register admin
POST {{url}}/api/accounts/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Mungai",
    "email": "mungai@example.com",
    "password": "mungai123",
    "password2": "mungai123",
    "first_name": "Sheilla",
    "last_name": "Mungai",
