### Add Grade - Mathematics
POST {{url}}/api/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject": "MATHEMATICS",
    "grade": "A"
}

### Add Grade - English
POST {{url}}/api/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject": "ENGLISH",
    "grade": "B+"
}

### Add Grade - Kiswahili
POST {{url}}/api/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject": "KISWAHILI",
    "grade": "A-"
}

### Add Grade - Physics
POST {{url}}/api/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject": "PHYSICS",
    "grade": "B"
}

### Add Grade - Chemistry
POST {{url}}/api/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject": "CHEMISTRY",
    "grade": "B+"
}

### Get All Grades (with statistics)
GET {{url}}/api/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Single Grade by ID
GET {{url}}/api/grades/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Update Grade
PATCH {{url}}/api/grades/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "grade": "A-"
}

### Delete Grade
DELETE {{url}}/api/grades/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ==================== STUDENT PREFERENCES ====================

### Get Preferences (auto-creates if doesn't exist)
GET {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create/Update Preferences
POST {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "preferred_subjects": ["MATHEMATICS", "PHYSICS", "CHEMISTRY"],
    "preferred_career_fields": ["Engineering", "Computer Science", "Data Science"],
    "preferred_institutions": ["University of Nairobi", "JKUAT", "Strathmore"],
    "location_preference": "Nairobi"
}

### Update Preferences (Partial)
PATCH {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "location_preference": "Mombasa",
    "preferred_career_fields": ["Medicine", "Pharmacy", "Nursing"]
}

### Update Only Preferred Subjects
PATCH {{url}}/api/preferences/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "preferred_subjects": ["BIOLOGY", "CHEMISTRY", "PHYSICS"]
}